      47.85,
      363.49,
      539.9,
      398.56
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under paragraph 8(b) of Section 154(b) of the constitution of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka, I, P. B. Disanayake, Governor of the North Central Province declare hereby that the fifth session ofthe six Provincial Council of the North Central Province came to end on mid-night of December 09th 2016, and",
    "fonts": [
