      411.49,
      539.91,
      446.56
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of powers vested in me under Paragraph 8(a) of Section 154(b) of the aforesaid constitution, declarehereby that the six session of the sixth Provincial Council of the North Central Province shall meet at 10.00 a. m. onJanuary 31st 2017, at conference hall of the North Central Provincial Council.",
